When building or styling **UI components, pages, dashboards, or design systems**, follow the **micrographic** skill at `.cursor/skills/micrographic/SKILL.md`.

Trigger when the user mentions micrographic, spec sheet, technical grid, industrial aesthetic, blueprint UI, dense information UI, schematic interface, brutalist typography, or wants UI that feels like product labels, hardware spec sheets, or care tags.

Core constraints: compression not minimalism; metadata as texture; **two type scales only** (display vs micro); near-monochrome palette with signal accents (orange/red/yellow); schematic geometry (grids, hairlines, corner brackets, dimension lines).
